          <p>Host-led activities across Victoria, with the Melbourne event at Inspire9 on Saturday 19 September: install fests for laptops that can't run Windows 11 and older Macs, an open exchange, talks and discussion.</p>
          <p class="confirm">To confirm: the final list of locations, and event photos. Only three photos from that day were on the phone, none of them at Inspire9, and there are none on Nextcloud. This iMac shot is from 10:36am on the 19th and its location needs checking.</p>
